  "boundaries": [
    "Every case's expected result is written in the plan and pinned before the case runs.",
    "Cases run only against a local build the plan names; never production, a shared test environment or another party's service.",
    "Inputs are stored escaped with their SHA-256; raw invisible, control and direction characters never enter a record.",
    "The pack's code builds cases in memory and prints them; it sends nothing, opens no network connection and calls no model.",
    "Workers create nouns and propose verbs; an authorized requester enqueues the proposals worth doing.",
    "Importing the pack writes nothing, enqueues nothing and installs no code."
  ],
